 on what  saint paul is saying so thanks everybody  for your time and i'll talk to you very  soon  as you know the symbolic world is not  just a bunch of videos on youtube we are  also a podcast which you can find on  your uh usual podcast platform but we  also have a website with a blog and  several very interesting articles by  very intelligent people that have been  thinking about symbolism on all kinds of  subjects we also have a clips channel a  facebook group you know there's a whole  lot of ways that you can get more  involved in the exploration and the  discussion of symbolism don't forget  that my brother matsuya wrote a book  called the language of creation which is  a very powerful synthesis of a lot of  the ideas that explore and so please  go ahead and explore this world you can  also participate by you know buying  things that i've designed t-shirts with  different designs on them and you can  also support this podcast and these  videos through paypal or through patreon  everybody who supports me has access to  an extra video a month and there are  also all kinds of other goodies and  tiers that you can get involved with so  everybody thank you again and thank you  for your support
 

